        "objective": "Local saddle loss L_i(u,v)=A_i[0,0]*u^2/2+A_i[0,1]*u*v-A_i[1,1]*v^2/2+b_i[0]*u-b_i[1]*v. Operator g_i=[dL_i/du,-dL_i/dv]=A_i*[u,v]+b_i. Global saddle loss is the mean of local losses.",
        "x0": [
